        "id": 224979,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-14T13:00:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's honestly not too bad, all things considered. It's just real easy to have it go quickly off the rails (train puns) if you do the wrong thing. Like, I always discarded the top card of Fright Train's deck with that first Wrecking Uppercut, which means I just lucked into making the game a little easier on myself.</p>",
